[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0010","text":"────咦\n死路了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0020","text":"嗯～\n上面写着“请用力推”呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0030","text":"逃脱游戏……是靠蛮力的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0040","text":"嗯、嗯……\n不是猜谜之类的啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0050","text":"谁先去？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0060","text":"────最初是拳头……\n剪—刀—石────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0070","text":"布／剪刀／剪刀……！／剪刀～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0080","text":"加油—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0090","text":"啊哈～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0100","text":"好\n……要上吗，那就"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32000100_03_0110","text":"────出拳头"}]
